# OSRS Wiki Prices API requires a descriptive User-Agent with contact info.
# Generic UAs may be rate-limited or blocked. Set this to a real email or
# Discord handle the wiki operators can use to reach you if your usage causes
# issues. See https://oldschool.runescape.wiki/w/RuneScape:Real-time_Prices
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in your contact value.

WIKI_USER_AGENT_CONTACT=your-email@example.com
